### ============================================


### Expenses


### ============================================


### Create Expense

POST {{baseUrl}}/budget/expenses HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "description": "Groceries",
  "expense_date": "2026-02-17",
  "notes": "Weekly grocery shopping",
  "recurring_type": "one-time",
  "priority": "need",
  "status": "posted",
  "is_debt": false
}


### List Expenses

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses?page=1&page_size=20 HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### test

GET http://localhost:6968/api/budget/expenses?page=1&page_size=20 HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

### List Expenses (Filtered)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses?start_date=2026-02-01&end_date=2026-02-28&priority=need&status=posted&page=1&page_size=50 HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Get Expense by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses/{expense_id} HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Update Expense

PUT {{baseUrl}}/budget/expenses/{expense_id} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "amount": 550.00,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "description": "Groceries (Updated)",
  "expense_date": "2026-02-17",
  "notes": "Weekly grocery shopping - updated",
  "recurring_type": "one-time",
  "priority": "need",
  "status": "posted",
  "is_debt": false
}


### Delete Expense

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budget/expenses/{expense_id} HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Search Expenses

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses/search?q=groceries&page=1&page_size=20 HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Skip Expense

POST {{baseUrl}}/budget/expenses/skip HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "id": "{expense_id}"
}


### Check Skipped Expenses

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses/check-skipped?start_date=2026-02-01&end_date=2026-02-28 HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Add Tag to Expense

POST {{baseUrl}}/budget/expenses/{expense_id}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "tag_id": "{tag_id}"
}


### Get Tags for Expense

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses/{expense_id}/tags HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Remove Tag from Expense

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budget/expenses/{expense_id}/tags/{tag_id} HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


