### Recurring Expenses (Full CRUD)


### ============================================


### Create Recurring Expense Rule

POST {{baseUrl}}/budget/recurring-expenses HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "description": "Monthly Internet Bill",
  "category_id": null,
  "notes": "Converge fiber",
  "recurring_type": "monthly",
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2026-12-31",
  "priority": "need"
}


### List Recurring Expense Rules

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/recurring-expenses HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Get Recurring Expense Rule

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/recurring-expenses/{expense_rule_id} HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


### Update Recurring Expense Rule

PUT {{baseUrl}}/budget/recurring-expenses/{expense_rule_id} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "amount": 1800.00,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "description": "Monthly Internet Bill (Updated)",
  "category_id": null,
  "notes": "Converge fiber - plan upgrade",
  "recurring_type": "monthly",
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2026-12-31",
  "priority": "need"
}


### Delete Recurring Expense Rule

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budget/recurring-expenses/{expense_rule_id} HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: {{userId}}


